# LuxOS - sablona softwaru "Hry" (format viz everyday.list)
# Steam potrebuje repozitar multilib (zapne se v /etc/pacman.conf) a 32bitove ovladace
# k ovladacum zvolenym luxos-hwdetect; bez znameho GPU softwarovy Vulkan (jinak by pacman
# --noconfirm vybral prvniho poskytovatele = NVIDIA).
@name Gaming
@description Steam with Proton for Windows games, GameMode for better performance and the MangoHud overlay.
@apps Steam · GameMode · MangoHud
@icon applications-games
@repo multilib
@order 40
@download 650
steam
gamemode
lib32-gamemode
mangohud
lib32-mangohud
lib32-mesa ?mesa
lib32-vulkan-intel ?vulkan-intel
lib32-vulkan-radeon ?vulkan-radeon
lib32-vulkan-nouveau ?vulkan-nouveau
lib32-nvidia-utils ?nvidia-utils
# legacy ovladace NVIDIA z [luxos] (Maxwell/Pascal/Volta, Kepler)
lib32-nvidia-580xx-utils ?nvidia-580xx-utils
lib32-nvidia-470xx-utils ?nvidia-470xx-utils
vulkan-swrast ?!vulkan-intel,vulkan-radeon,vulkan-nouveau,nvidia-utils,nvidia-580xx-utils,nvidia-470xx-utils
lib32-vulkan-swrast ?!vulkan-intel,vulkan-radeon,vulkan-nouveau,nvidia-utils,nvidia-580xx-utils,nvidia-470xx-utils
